: "engenn5le02ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "Vladimir Lenin walks the halls of the Kremlin! My Russian guide told me this story!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "My uncle worked in the Kremlin archives. He met a KGB man there. This man heard footsteps in Lenin's rooms at night. He often stood outside the heavy wooden door to the apartment. He heard furniture moving. When he opened the door, he saw no one.", "time": "5500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "However, Lenin's old rotary telephone from his desk was on the floor! The desk chair was pushed back. The large leather diary was open to the night Lenin died! Who could get into a locked, guarded room?\nIf you see a small bearded man in an old-fashioned suit in the Kremlin, stop and look! It could be Vladimir Lenin!", "time": "23000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Vladimir Lenin walks the halls of the Kremlin! My Russian guide told me this story!<br/><br/>\nMy uncle worked in the Kremlin archives. He met a KGB man there. This man heard footsteps in Lenin's rooms at night. He often stood outside the heavy wooden door to the apartment. He heard furniture moving. When he opened the door, he saw no one.<br/><br/>\nHowever, Lenin's old rotary telephone from his desk was on the floor! The desk chair was pushed back. The large leather diary was open to the night Lenin died! Who could get into a locked, guarded room? If you see a small bearded man in an old-fashioned suit in the Kremlin, stop and look! It could be Vladimir Lenin!"}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}